---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Shipping and returns" description="Shipping and returns for Energy Peptides.">
  <section class="section container legal-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Policy</p>
    <h1 class="t-section">Shipping and returns</h1>
    <div class="prose measure">
<h2>Shipping</h2>
<p>Orders ship within the United States only. Flat-rate shipping is $9.95; orders over $150 ship free. Lyophilized peptides are shipped sealed with cold packs where appropriate. Orders placed before 2 pm ET on a business day usually ship the same day.</p>
<h2>Returns</h2>
<p>Research materials cannot be returned once shipped. If a shipment arrives damaged or incorrect, contact support@energypeptides.us within 7 days of delivery with your order number and a photo, and we will replace or refund it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .legal-page { max-width: var(--measure); display: grid; gap: var(--s5); }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: var(--s5); }
  .prose p, .prose li { color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: var(--s2); }
  .prose ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .prose .muted { color: var(--text-faint); font-size: 14px; }
</style>
